WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.901
It's a dark day.

2
00:00:01.902 --> 00:00:03.837
The sky is gray.

3
00:00:03.838 --> 00:00:06.247
And the air is cool.

4
00:00:06.248 --> 00:00:08.412
Not much to do.

5
00:00:08.413 --> 00:00:11.199
It's the end of winter.

6
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.288
It's a gloomy day.

7
00:00:13.289 --> 00:00:16.100
The snow is melting away.

8
00:00:16.101 --> 00:00:18.583
The trees have no leaves.

9
00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:20.767
Not much to see.

10
00:00:20.768 --> 00:00:23.481
It's the end of winter.

11
00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:25.713
It's a slow day.

12
00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:28.291
The butterflies are away.

13
00:00:28.292 --> 00:00:30.827
The animals are inside.

14
00:00:30.828 --> 00:00:33.086
Nature is hiding.

15
00:00:33.087 --> 00:00:36.099
It's the end of winter.

16
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.445
It's a boring day.

17
00:00:38.446 --> 00:00:41.718
There are no kids outside at play.

18
00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:44.630
My bike and ball are packed.

19
00:00:44.631 --> 00:00:47.693
My tent and rope are stacked.

20
00:00:47.694 --> 00:00:50.684
It's the end of winter.

21
00:00:50.685 --> 00:00:53.295
But soon!

22
00:00:53.296 --> 00:00:55.854
It will be a bright day.

23
00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.396
The sun will shine its rays.

24
00:00:58.397 --> 00:01:01.330
And the air will warm our hearts.

25
00:01:01.331 --> 00:01:04.199
There'll be lots of games to start.

26
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.076
It will be spring.

27
00:01:07.077 --> 00:01:09.857
It will be a happy day.

28
00:01:09.858 --> 00:01:13.114
The grass will be green and straight.

29
00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:16.493
The trees will get fresh new blooms.

30
00:01:16.494 --> 00:01:18.572
There'll be lots to do.

31
00:01:18.573 --> 00:01:21.379
It will be spring.

32
00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.776
It will be a busy day.

33
00:01:23.777 --> 00:01:27.357
The butterflies will dance and sway.

34
00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:29.697
The animals will be running.

35
00:01:29.698 --> 00:01:32.148
Nature will be stunning.

36
00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:34.881
It will be spring.

37
00:01:34.882 --> 00:01:37.390
It will be a fun day.

38
00:01:37.391 --> 00:01:40.763
I will ride my bike a long way.

39
00:01:40.764 --> 00:01:43.674
I will jump rope with my friends.

40
00:01:43.675 --> 00:01:47.786
We will play outside until the day ends.

41
00:01:47.787 --> 00:01:50.692
It will be spring.

42
00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:53.222
I will be very happy.

43
00:01:53.223 --> 00:01:55.764
It makes me want to sing.

44
00:01:55.765 --> 00:02:04.541
But for now, I can only dream of spring.

